L259: 7.3 QUATERNIONIC-QUANTUM-PHYSICS
L260: Generalized quantum physics in which real quaternions are used instead of complex numbers as the scalar field.
L261: In the \TeXsource of the bibliography the keyword QUATERNIONIC-QUANTUM-PHYSICS is abbreviated QQPH, and there two special keywords: QQPH/CERN for the publications of the CERN-University-of-Geneva school (led by J.M. Jauch) and QQPH/ALDER for the papers of S.L. Adler and his followers.
