L284: 8.2 GRASSMANN (“Grassmann’s calculus of extensions”)
L285: Hermann G. Grassmann’s “calculus of extensions” of 1844/1862 is the first attempt to define explicitly the notions of “n-dimensional vector space,” and of “internal” and “external” products of vectors.
