L288: 8.3 CLIFFORD (“Clifford numbers”)
L289: William K. Clifford introduced in 1873 two different kind of 8-dimensional algebras that he called “biquaternions,” and then in 1878 a general theory of linear associative algebras of dimension 2^n, denoted Cl_{p,q} where n = p + q.
