L298: 8.6 HESTENES (“Hestenes’s space-time algebra”)
L299: Hestenes’s 16-dimensional “space-time algebra” formalism (based on the Clifford algebra Cl_{1,3}) was designed in 1966 to provide a substitute for the standard 32-dimensional Dirac formalism (equivalent to the Clifford algebra Cl_{4,1}) such that all references to complex numbers are avoided.
