L302: 9 MISCELLANEA
L303: 9.1 HISTORY and APPRECIATION
L304: Historical papers on quaternions and on Hamilton (1805–1865), as well as some appreciations of quaternions and Hamilton’s devotion to them.
L305: Historical papers on algebras in general.
L306: The historical papers on specific formalisms allied to quaternions are in the respective sections of Chap. 8.
